cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Coupon Management Platform
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Django web application implemented against two database backends —
  PostgreSQL (relational) and MongoDB (document-oriented, via Djongo) — for
  community-driven coupon sharing. The same application layer runs on both
  engines to compare relational and document storage under identical workloads,
  with Locust load-test scenarios and seed scripts for reproducible
  benchmarking. Developed as a team project at TH Köln (University of Applied
  Sciences).
